00:01:34.420 --> 00:01:35.480
and messy.

00:01:36.860 --> 00:01:43.550
The other thing, the other source of data we created was a project log, something like

00:01:43.550 --> 00:01:44.200
SAP.

00:01:44.200 --> 00:01:54.280
And these have the change order log, these have the change order requests, and these tend

00:01:54.280 --> 00:02:02.380
